# sparse-read: harness compares the zero-filled view, extents may legitimately differ
writefull "head"
---
write 8192 "tail"
---
sparse-read 0 10000
---
sparse-read 0 4
---
# range inside the hole
sparse-read 100 100
---
# offset == size is success (strict > rule), empty
sparse-read 8196 10
---
sparse-read 9000 10
---
sparse-read 8190 100
